📌 Project Overview

This project focuses on developing a system that summarizes lengthy articles, blogs, or news into concise summaries.
Using the CNN/Daily Mail Dataset, we implement both extractive and abstractive summarization techniques.

🗂 Dataset
Source: CNN/Daily Mail Dataset
Content: News articles with corresponding highlights serving as reference summaries.

🔍 Data Preprocessing
Cleaned and tokenized textual data for efficient summarization.
Removed unnecessary characters, stop words, and normalized text.


